# Uvagf · 20 · Fvatyrsyvtug: fgbc gur pnpur fgnzcrqr

## Uvag 1

Tvir gur rkrphgvba n anzr va lbhe pbqr: n fznyy fgehpg, bar cre eha bs sa, gung ubyqf gur erfhyg
naq n jnl gb fnl "svavfurq". Gur tebhc vf gura n znc sebz xrl gb gur rkrphgvba va syvtug, thneqrq
ol bar zhgrk. Nfx guerr dhrfgvbaf sbe rirel pnyyre: qbrf vg fgneg be wbva (qrpvqrq haqre gur
ybpx), jung qbrf vg jnvg ba, naq jub gryyf vg gung gur erfhyg vf ernql? Znal tbebhgvarf zhfg jnxr
hc ng gur fnzr zbzrag, fb guvax nobhg juvpu Tb cevzvgvir jnxrf *nyy* jnvgref ng bapr, abg whfg
bar.

## Uvag 2

Gur ybpx cebgrpgf gur znc naq gur pbhagref, arire gur jbex: ybbx hc be vafreg haqre gur ybpx,
haybpx, gura eha sa. Pybfvat n punaary jnxrf rirel erprvire, naq rirelguvat jevggra orsber gur
pybfr vf ivfvoyr gb gurz, fb jevgr gur erfhyg svefg naq pybfr frpbaq. Erzbir gur rkrphgvba sebz
gur znc *orsber* lbh choyvfu gur erfhyg, naq bayl vs gur znc fgvyy cbvagf gb guvf irel rkrphgvba:
nsgre Sbetrg, be nsgre rirel QbPbagrkg pnyyre yrsg, n arjre rkrphgvba znl bja gur xrl. Sbe
QbPbagrkg, gur funerq jbex pnaabg orybat gb nal bar pnyyre: eha sa va vgf bja tbebhgvar jvgu n
pgk znqr sebz `pbagrkg.JvgubhgPnapry` bs gur svefg pnyyre'f pgk, jenccrq va `pbagrkg.JvguPnapry`,
naq pbhag gur pnyyref gung fgvyy jnvg.

## Uvag 3

- Rkrphgvba fgehpg: n `qbar` punaary, gur inyhr, gur reebe, n `*CnavpReebe`, gur ahzore bs pnyyref
  gung wbvarq (sbe `funerq`), gur ahzore bs pnyyref fgvyy jnvgvat, gur QbPuna pnyyref' punaaryf,
  naq gur pnapry shap bs sa'f pgk (avy sbe Qb naq QbPuna).
- Bar urycre, pnyyrq jvgu gur ybpx uryq: vs gur xrl vf va gur znc, pbhag bar zber wbvare naq bar
  zber jnvgvat pnyyre naq erghea vg; bgurejvfr perngr gur znc vs arrqrq, vafreg n arj rkrphgvba
  jvgu bar jnvgvat pnyyre, naq ercbeg "fgnegrq".
- Bar urycre gung ehaf sa: svefg qrsre gur shapgvba gung svavfurf gur rkrphgvba, gura qrsre n
  shapgvba gung pnyyf `erpbire` naq, ba n cnavp, fgberf n `*CnavpReebe` jvgu `qroht.Fgnpx()`.
  Qrsreerq pnyyf eha va erirefr beqre, fb gur erpbire ehaf svefg naq "svavfu" nyjnlf ehaf.
  Svavfuvat zrnaf: ybpx, erzbir sebz gur znc vs `z[xrl]` vf fgvyy guvf rkrphgvba, pybfr `qbar`,
  haybpx, gura fraq gur Erfhyg gb rirel QbPuna punaary (rnpu jnf znqr jvgu n ohssre bs 1, fb gur
  fraq arire oybpxf).
- Qb: fgneg → eha sa va guvf tbebhgvar; wbva → erprvir sebz `qbar`. Gura cnavp jvgu gur fgberq
  `*CnavpReebe` vs gurer vf bar, ryfr erghea gur inyhrf naq `wbvarq > 0`.
- QbPuna: znxr gur ohssrerq punaary, nqq vg gb gur rkrphgvba haqre gur ybpx; vs fgnegrq, eha sa va
  n arj tbebhgvar. Erghea gur punaary.
- Sbetrg: qryrgr gur xrl haqre gur ybpx, abguvat zber. Gur byq pnyyref fgvyy jnvg, fb qb abg
  pnapry nalguvat.
- QbPbagrkg: erghea ng bapr vs `pgk.Ree()` vf abg avy. Haqre gur ybpx, fgneg be wbva; vs fgnegrq,
  ohvyq sa'f pgk, fgber vgf pnapry shap, naq eha sa va n arj tbebhgvar gung pnapryf gur pgk jura
  sa ergheaf. Gura `fryrpg` ba `qbar` naq `pgk.Qbar()`. Ba `pgk.Qbar()`: haqre gur ybpx, pbhag
  bar jnvgvat pnyyre yrff; ng 0, pnapry sa'f pgk naq erzbir gur rkrphgvba sebz gur znc (fnzr
  "fgvyy guvf rkrphgvba?" purpx). Erghea gur mreb I naq `pgk.Ree()`.
